      "review_description": "After getting a number of quotes from (some via Solar Quotes, some elsewhere) I always felt I was being \"pitched\" to, and the rep was more sales-focused than actually looking at my issues. After a personal recommendation, I had Aaron from Solar Share Project over and was much more comfortable going ahead than before. He organised the install date incredibly quickly and went above and beyond in the actual work. My terrace house is old, and while I thought we may have had some issues, neither of us could have predicted some of the challenges. Despite that, he worked with me to find solutions, and I couldn't be happier. Still early days, but he continues to communicate promptly, and has been adjusting settings and keeping in touch about the fine-tuning in getting my system at peak performance",
